WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.600
High alert

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:00.867
on the

00:00:00.867 --> 00:00:02.402
Israeli-Lebanese border

00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:03.970
after dozens of rockets

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:05.672
were fired from Lebanon

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:07.741
into Israel earlier today.

00:00:07.741 --> 00:00:09.242
Israel says many,

00:00:09.242 --> 00:00:11.344
but not all of them were intercepted

00:00:11.344 --> 00:00:13.546
and it has now closed down

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:15.348
its northern airspace.

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:17.150
This latest episode comes after Israeli

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:19.219
forces stormed the Al-Aqsa

00:00:19.219 --> 00:00:21.755
Mosque one of Islam's holiest sites

00:00:21.988 --> 00:00:24.024
for the second time late last night.

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:24.991
Now, Israeli

00:00:24.991 --> 00:00:26.793
police say they entered the mosque

00:00:26.793 --> 00:00:28.561
after, quote, dozens of law

00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:30.030
breaking juveniles

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:31.531
threw fireworks and stones

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:33.533
and barricaded themselves inside.

00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:34.367
All of this happening

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:36.736
during a holy period for both Islamic

00:00:37.003 --> 00:00:38.705
and Jewish faiths.

00:00:38.705 --> 00:00:41.141
Elliot King is in Jerusalem for us.

00:00:41.174 --> 00:00:41.941
Eliot,

00:00:41.941 --> 00:00:43.276
bring us up to speed

00:00:43.276 --> 00:00:44.310
on where things

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:46.346
stand on the ground right now,

00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:47.180
beginning with the latest

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:49.215
round of rocket fire

00:00:51.117 --> 00:00:53.720
Abbi, just this hour, we've received

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:54.421
more reports

00:00:54.421 --> 00:00:55.655
from the IDF

00:00:55.655 --> 00:00:57.524
that there were three mortars

00:00:57.524 --> 00:00:59.125
fired from southern Lebanon.

00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:01.161
Towards the town of Metula in Israel's

00:01:01.161 --> 00:01:02.829
far north near the border.

00:01:02.829 --> 00:01:03.163
And this,

00:01:03.163 --> 00:01:03.630
as you say,

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:04.831
followed a barrage

00:01:04.831 --> 00:01:06.132
of some three dozen

00:01:06.132 --> 00:01:08.234
rockets fired towards Israel

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:10.236
from southern Lebanon earlier today.

00:01:10.236 --> 00:01:11.738
That's the biggest barrage

00:01:11.738 --> 00:01:13.006
since war,

00:01:13.006 --> 00:01:14.374
a war between Israel

00:01:14.374 --> 00:01:16.142
and the Iranian backed militants

00:01:16.142 --> 00:01:19.446
of Hezbollah in 2006.

00:01:19.612 --> 00:01:21.347
But it's very important to note

00:01:21.347 --> 00:01:24.417
that Israel, the way we spoke

00:01:24.417 --> 00:01:25.318
with the

00:01:25.385 --> 00:01:26.553
international spokesperson

00:01:26.553 --> 00:01:28.421
from the IDF, Richard Hecht,

00:01:28.421 --> 00:01:29.656
and he says that they believe

00:01:29.656 --> 00:01:31.291
that it was either Hamas

00:01:31.291 --> 00:01:33.560
or Palestinian Islamic Jihad

00:01:33.827 --> 00:01:36.629
that was responsible for firing towards

00:01:36.629 --> 00:01:38.264
Israel from southern Lebanon.

00:01:38.264 --> 00:01:40.567
In other words, it wasn't Hezbollah.

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:41.568
And that's significant

00:01:41.568 --> 00:01:43.503
because if it was Hezbollah

00:01:43.503 --> 00:01:45.004
and then Israel presumably

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:46.372
will at some point retaliate,

00:01:46.372 --> 00:01:47.273
it says that

00:01:47.273 --> 00:01:48.942
it will decide on the place

00:01:48.942 --> 00:01:50.844
and time of its response.

00:01:50.844 --> 00:01:52.612
Right now, it hasn't responded.

00:01:52.612 --> 00:01:54.013
Contrary to earlier reports,

00:01:54.013 --> 00:01:55.381
if it was Hezbollah

00:01:55.381 --> 00:01:56.983
and then Israel responded towards

00:01:56.983 --> 00:01:58.184
Hezbollah, positions,

00:01:58.184 --> 00:01:59.752
then that could potentially

00:01:59.752 --> 00:02:01.087
see things escalating,

00:02:01.087 --> 00:02:02.388
perhaps towards the level

00:02:02.388 --> 00:02:03.590
that we saw the last time.

00:02:03.590 --> 00:02:04.224
There was an all out

00:02:04.224 --> 00:02:06.993
war between the two sides in 2006

00:02:06.993 --> 00:02:08.027
the fact that it's from

00:02:08.027 --> 00:02:09.629
Palestinian factions

00:02:09.629 --> 00:02:10.864
should suggest that the response

00:02:10.864 --> 00:02:12.499
will be somewhat more measured Abbi.

00:02:14.267 --> 00:02:14.567
All right.

00:02:14.567 --> 00:02:15.568
Eliot Cohen, thank

00:02:15.568 --> 00:02:17.237
you very much for that report.

00:02:17.237 --> 00:02:18.271
And for more on this now,

00:02:18.271 --> 00:02:19.572
let's bring in Dennis Ross.

00:02:19.572 --> 00:02:20.640
He's a longtime peace

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:21.908
negotiator under Republican

00:02:21.908 --> 00:02:23.743
and Democratic administrations,

00:02:23.743 --> 00:02:24.477
including serving

00:02:24.477 --> 00:02:25.879
as a former special Middle East

00:02:25.879 --> 00:02:27.981
coordinator under President Clinton

00:02:27.981 --> 00:02:29.115
and a special assistant

00:02:29.115 --> 00:02:30.350
under President Obama.

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:31.718
He's now a counselor

00:02:31.718 --> 00:02:33.153
at the Washington Institute

00:02:33.153 --> 00:02:34.587
for Near East Policy.

00:02:34.587 --> 00:02:36.456
Dennis, thanks for joining us.

00:02:36.456 --> 00:02:37.524
First to start,

00:02:37.524 --> 00:02:39.259
can you just give us your reaction

00:02:39.259 --> 00:02:42.328
to what we have seen transpire in Israel

00:02:42.328 --> 00:02:44.597
over the last two days?

00:02:46.199 --> 00:02:47.267
Well, look, we are

00:02:47.267 --> 00:02:49.369
we always knew that the reality

00:02:49.369 --> 00:02:50.670
of having Ramadan

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:53.039
on one hand and Passover on the other

00:02:53.506 --> 00:02:55.041
take place at the same time.

00:02:55.041 --> 00:02:57.110
Was bound to create

00:02:57.110 --> 00:02:59.312
a real potential for violence,

00:02:59.312 --> 00:03:00.813
especially triggered

00:03:00.813 --> 00:03:03.616
by those who would like to see violence.

00:03:03.616 --> 00:03:05.018
We know that those who

00:03:05.018 --> 00:03:06.186
barricaded themselves

00:03:06.186 --> 00:03:08.521
within the Oscar mosque last night

00:03:08.521 --> 00:03:10.089
had the very real purpose

00:03:10.089 --> 00:03:12.292
of wanting to trigger something.

00:03:12.292 --> 00:03:14.594
We know what's happened now.

00:03:14.594 --> 00:03:15.695
It was not Hezbollah

00:03:15.695 --> 00:03:18.097
that launched these rockets from Lebanon.

00:03:18.097 --> 00:03:19.666
It was Hamas.

00:03:19.666 --> 00:03:22.001
And as Hamas is launching from Lebanon,

00:03:22.001 --> 00:03:24.270
it's not launching from Gaza.

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:26.105
There were a couple that were fired,

00:03:26.105 --> 00:03:27.140
but they're basically trying

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:28.641
to shift the focus.

00:03:28.641 --> 00:03:30.510
It signals that they don't want

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:32.045
war over Gaza,

00:03:32.045 --> 00:03:33.179
but they also feel that

00:03:33.179 --> 00:03:34.113
it was constrained

00:03:34.113 --> 00:03:35.715
by what it can do in Lebanon

00:03:35.715 --> 00:03:37.250
because of Hezbollah.

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:38.918
Hezbollah itself

00:03:38.918 --> 00:03:40.420
allows Hamas to operate

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:41.221
and then claims

00:03:41.221 --> 00:03:42.855
it had nothing to do with this.

00:03:42.855 --> 00:03:44.190
So all of this suggests

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:45.091
that we're at a point

00:03:45.091 --> 00:03:47.260
where there's great potential

00:03:47.260 --> 00:03:48.194
for escalation

00:03:48.194 --> 00:03:50.163
if one side or the other miscalculates.

00:03:51.364 --> 00:03:51.664
Yeah.

00:03:51.664 --> 00:03:53.366
I mean, I think to that point,

00:03:53.366 --> 00:03:55.001
how likely is it, given

00:03:55.001 --> 00:03:56.202
where we are right now,

00:03:56.202 --> 00:03:58.104
that this could spiral out of control?

00:03:58.104 --> 00:04:00.506
What would that even look like?

00:04:01.608 --> 00:04:03.610
I think Israel undoubtedly

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:04.277
will respond

00:04:04.277 --> 00:04:04.777
to the fact

00:04:04.777 --> 00:04:05.812
that there were three

00:04:05.812 --> 00:04:06.512
dozen rockets

00:04:06.512 --> 00:04:08.214
fired out of southern Lebanon

00:04:08.214 --> 00:04:09.282
and at least three mortar

00:04:09.282 --> 00:04:11.284
shells fired into the city.

00:04:11.284 --> 00:04:13.219
The town of Matula in the north.

00:04:13.219 --> 00:04:14.520
So Israel will retaliate.

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:16.289
They will probably try to retaliate

00:04:16.289 --> 00:04:17.724
in a way that hits

00:04:17.724 --> 00:04:19.192
only those areas

00:04:19.192 --> 00:04:21.995
where Hamas was operating if they hit

00:04:22.262 --> 00:04:23.896
targets that Hezbollah considers

00:04:23.896 --> 00:04:25.031
to be theirs, Hezbollah,

00:04:25.031 --> 00:04:26.933
then that Hezbollah

00:04:26.933 --> 00:04:28.134
may then

00:04:28.134 --> 00:04:28.568
decide

00:04:28.568 --> 00:04:31.204
that they will fire rockets into Israel.

00:04:31.204 --> 00:04:32.505
If the two of them begin

00:04:32.505 --> 00:04:34.474
an exchange that can easily spiral

00:04:34.474 --> 00:04:35.942
out of control quickly.

00:04:35.942 --> 00:04:37.143
Hezbollah can hit Israel

00:04:37.143 --> 00:04:38.811
with 3000 rockets a day

00:04:38.811 --> 00:04:40.013
for several weeks.

00:04:40.013 --> 00:04:41.080
Israel won't take that.

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:42.482
They will end up going into Lebanon

00:04:42.482 --> 00:04:44.350
on the ground to try to stop that.

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:45.718
So you can see how quickly

00:04:45.718 --> 00:04:47.453
this could escalate

00:04:47.453 --> 00:04:49.155
and get out of control.

00:04:49.155 --> 00:04:50.423
My guess is neither

00:04:50.423 --> 00:04:52.258
side wants to get out of control,

00:04:52.258 --> 00:04:54.360
so it probably won't be

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:55.461
something that escalates that way.

00:04:55.461 --> 00:04:56.696
But there's clearly a danger.

00:04:56.696 --> 00:04:57.897
As I said,

00:04:57.930 --> 00:04:59.866
calculations always seem great.

00:04:59.866 --> 00:05:00.833
When you're in the abstract

00:05:00.833 --> 00:05:02.235
or in the laboratory.

00:05:02.235 --> 00:05:04.237
When real fire begins, a lot of things go

00:05:04.237 --> 00:05:04.804
out the window.

00:05:06.005 --> 00:05:06.873
Yeah, it

00:05:06.873 --> 00:05:08.007
remains a very dangerous

00:05:08.007 --> 00:05:09.942
and volatile situation right now.

00:05:09.942 --> 00:05:11.077
Former Ambassador

00:05:11.077 --> 00:05:11.611
Dennis Ross,

00:05:11.611 --> 00:05:13.079
thank you very much for joining us.

